  "body": "LOT-057\nCloses #355\nClaim: mac/M1\n\n**Problem.** LOT-057 (#83) reads the anonymous REST lists on page 1 only and handles every REST failure the same way (fallback to the HTML page), because only `R57a`-`R57c` were captured.\n\n**What was captured** (anonymous, read-only GETs, 2026-11-13, at least 60 s apart, `flows.py`, published with `publish.py` from its own fragment `corpus.d/355-rest-paging-errors.json`):\n\n| Id | Request | Answer |\n|---|---|---|\n| `R57d` | `categories/13/topics/last/&page=1` (fresh page 1, so page 2 is compared with a page of the same minute) | 200, 5 sticky + 25 |\n| `R57e` | the same, `&page=2` | 200, 25 rows, **no sticky**, same `results_count` |\n| `R57f` | `&page=1&results_per_page=50` | 200, `results_per_page` 50, 5 sticky + 50 = the topics of `R57d` + `R57e` |\n| `R57g` | a page past the last (⌈`results_count` / 25⌉ + 1) | 200, `resources` empty, `page` echoed |\n| `R57h` | `/api/forums/hardwarefr/categories/` as is | Apache 404, `text/html` |\n| `R57i` | unknown category `categories/999/topics/last/` | 200 JSON, `error:true`, `error_code` 403 |\n| `R57j` | unknown topic `categories/13/topics/999999999/` | 200, **a placeholder topic** (empty title, null date, closed + sticky, posts count 1), no `error` key |\n| `R57k` | unknown resource `forums/hardwarefr/nothing/` | 200 JSON, `error:true`, `error_code` 404 |\n\nNone sets a cookie or redirects. No answer carries a page count. Recorded in HFR-PROTOCOL §6c LOT-057 (verified) and the §7 REST row.\n\n**Anonymization.**\n- `publish.py` aliased the authors and last authors (member positions) and the avatar ids.\n- `anonymize.py check --corpus`: 707 of 707 clean.\n- `check --config` on the eight files: clean.\n- `manifest_check.py`: OK. Kit tests: 398 OK. `fold.py --check` and `check-lot-deps.py`: OK.\n- Independent grep from the raw files (author and last-author titles and `tns3` ids, my own JSON walk):\n  - 0 whole-word occurrence of the 106 member names, 0 of the 93 avatar ids, no cookie name.\n  - One 4-letter name occurs only as a substring inside a longer word of a public topic title; it is not a mention.\n\n**No ledger entry** (captures only).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CJ1auuPWv2FeT7Q4Ps\n",
